<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bethlehem Steel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bethlehem Steel raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Ken Hoffman upgraded Bethlehem Steel Corp to buy from hold, his office said.</p>
<p>-- raised the earnings estimate to $1.10 per share from $0.80 for 1997, and to $1.40 from $0.85, his office said.</p>
</text>
